# Sci-fi ground recipes (D34, owner: "our own scifi in / outside"). New patterns: plate (hull panels with rivets), grating (deck slats), circuit (traces and nodes), all 24 px periodic. Lore nods (DOC): hull = the SSOL timeship, deck = station floors, circuit = Avanta.C, regolith = Lunaria, rust = the Mars colony, sunmetal = the Metal Sun.
RECIPE | hull     | 212 | 14 | 46 | 28 | plate   | 1 | 7701
RECIPE | deck     | 220 | 8  | 28 | 34 | grating | 1 | 7802
RECIPE | circuit  | 188 | 60 | 30 | 38 | circuit | 1 | 7903
RECIPE | regolith | 40  | 6  | 52 | 20 | noise   | 2 | 8004
RECIPE | rust     | 14  | 58 | 36 | 28 | noise   | 1 | 8105
RECIPE | sunmetal | 32  | 78 | 52 | 32 | plate   | 1 | 8206
